  "description": "\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOSM Polygon Image Tag\n\t\n\nThis dataset connects OpenStreetMap polygons to image references found in their\ntags. It contains closed ways and relations only. A polygon row is one unique\nOSM feature. An image-asset row describes one image reference or one lookup\nresult for a feature.\nA tag value is the original reference. It may be a direct URL, a provider ID,\na UUID, or a category name; it is not always an image URL. image_assets keeps\nthat value and records the lookup result\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/NoeFlandre/osm-polygon-image-tag.",
  "alternateName": [
    "NoeFlandre/osm-polygon-image-tag"
  ],
